The Volkswagen Polo United trim was a special edition available on the Mk6 Polo (2017-present), primarily around 2020 and 2021. It was based on the SE trim but added extra features. Common engines were the 1.0 EVO 80 PS and 1.0 TSI 95 PS. I will evaluate based on the 2020/2021 Mk6 Polo United 1.0 TSI 95 PS, as it's the more powerful and commonly listed option.

*   **Price (price_usd):** Used prices for 2020/2021 Polo United models range from around £11,000 to £18,000+ in the UK. A new price for a 2020 United was listed at £17,350. These prices are well below the $52,000 market average for a new car. Score: 0.50.
